The patches/ directory modifies version-specific upstream behavior and checks
the expected source before applying changes. The extensions/ directory adds
the native account/editor UI and bundles the MCP and Agent bridge modules.
Dockerfile records the base and the build steps. Upstream copyright notices
and dependency licenses remain applicable to their respective code.
